ected promise and the same error. Only a synchronous factory throw would be retried.\",\"basis\":\"page\",\"quote\":\"Rejected promises stay cached; synchronous factory throws are retried.\",\"confidence\":85},{\"id\":\"Q6\",\"prediction\":\"No. All six caches were cleared synchronously before the project release was awaited, so the earlier entry is already gone even though release failed. The definition search runs fresh and refills the drawer.\",\"basis\":\"page\",\"quote\":\"Clear first; await project release next. Clearing stays synchronous.\",\"confidence\":78},{\"id\":\"Q7\",\"prediction\":\"Before: the worker reports release as successful. The dropped rejection is unhandled, which in a Node worker may later surface as a worker error or crash unrelated to the request. After: the rejection propagates through the backend, so the daemon's release request to the worker fails with A's cleanup error.\",\"basis\":\"inference\",\"quote\":\"\",\"confidence\":45}]}"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 6756, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 6756}, "output_tokens": 9, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "da7cc733-1e8f-494a-9a46-448e01419528", "uuid": "9ed56761-bd26-4246-b705-22bd84519264", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T06:50:29.693Z", "request_id": "req_011Cezzam82fG4n81rB1KxEw"}
